	optdepends = vulkan-radeon: Vulkan driver for AMD GPUs (one Vulkan driver is required)
	optdepends = vulkan-intel: Vulkan driver for Intel GPUs (one Vulkan driver is required)
	optdepends = nvidia-utils: Vulkan driver for NVIDIA GPUs (one Vulkan driver is required)
	optdepends = gst-plugins-bad: more GStreamer media formats
	optdepends = gst-libav: more GStreamer media formats (H.264, AAC, ...)
	optdepends = libvlc: in-world media through the VLC plugin
	optdepends = libdecor: window decorations on GNOME Wayland
	optdepends = xdg-utils: open web links in the system browser
	optdepends = libnotify: desktop notifications from the launcher
	optdepends = gamemode: Feral GameMode support
	optdepends = switcheroo-control: automatic GPU selection on hybrid-graphics laptops
